    "\n\nWARNING: %6$d of these modified blocks appear to also have\nchanged in the project. Merging will override changes in\nthe project with changes from the source code file.": "\n\n警告：其中 %6$d 处在工程里也改过。\n合并会用源代码里的修改覆盖工程里的修改。",
    "\n\nWARNING: no Node can be found for %4$d of these\nmodifications and they can not be merged back.": "\n\n警告：有 %4$d 处修改找不到对应节点，不能合并回来。",
    "\nMerging these changes back appears to be safe.": "\n把这些修改合并回来看起来是安全的。",
