    "text mode generates a \"const char*\" and a trailing NUL, compressed mode uses zlib to generate a binary block": "文本模式生成 const char* 并带结尾的空字符；压缩模式用 zlib 生成二进制块。",
    "Inline Data variables are declared \"const unsigned char []\" in binary mode and \"const char*\" in text mode.": "内嵌数据在二进制模式下声明为 const unsigned char []，文本模式下声明为 const char*。",
    "When instantiating a widget class, the children can either be fixed in their original position, automatically be repositioned, or both repsositioned and resized to fit the container.": "实例化控件类时，子控件可以保持原位置，或自动重排，或同时重排并缩放到容器里。",
